Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.51,0:00:01.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,Hey everyone!
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Day 1 of building
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.15,0:00:04.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,in public.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.17,0:00:04.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.43,0:00:05.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,I want to show you something
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.24,0:00:06.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,I've been working on.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.44,0:00:09.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's an interactive Koi Fish wallpaper.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.05,0:00:10.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,Just click anywhere on the water
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.35,0:00:11.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,to drop some fish food,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.94,0:00:13.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,and watch the koi swim towards
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.42,0:00:14.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,it and start eating.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.77,0:00:15.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,If the food lands on a
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.78,0:00:17.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,lotus leaf,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.01,0:00:19.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,the leaves actually move and react
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.44,0:00:20.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,to it.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.22,0:00:21.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,I've also added a lot of
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.43,0:00:23.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,little details to make the pond
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.05,0:00:24.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,feel alive:
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.33,0:00:25.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,realistic water ripples,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,tiny air bubbles,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.24,0:00:29.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,soft shadows from the lotus flowers,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,and much more.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.52,0:00:32.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,You can customize the experience,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.09,0:00:32.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.91,0:00:34.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,Change the number of fish in
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.05,0:00:34.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,the pond,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.98,0:00:36.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,adjust the frame rate up to
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.21,0:00:38.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,144 FPS,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.18,0:00:39.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,and choose the rendering quality,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.82,0:00:40.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,from low all the way up
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.86,0:00:41.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,to Ultra.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.94,0:00:43.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,But this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.82,0:00:45.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of adding a day-and-night
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.35,0:00:46.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,cycle,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.15,0:00:47.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,so you can experience the pond
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.69,0:00:48.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,under moonlight,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.68,0:00:50.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,along with a rainy weather effect,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.53,0:00:52.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,where raindrops create ripples across
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.69,0:00:53.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,the water.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.66,0:00:55.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,And one more thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.54,0:00:56.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm also looking for someone with
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.69,0:00:58.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,a similar mindset,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.05,0:01:00.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,who enjoys building products and experimenting
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.55,0:01:01.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,with ideas.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,I've worked on Android development,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.17,0:01:04.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.05,0:01:06.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'd love to collaborate,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.18,0:01:06.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,build,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.85,0:01:07.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,launch,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.69,0:01:09.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,and potentially sell products together.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.76,0:01:11.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,I think building together is more
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.37,0:01:12.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,fun.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,You share ideas,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.67,0:01:14.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,learn from each other,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.90,0:01:16.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,and create better things.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.60,0:01:17.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,If that sounds interesting,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.89,0:01:19.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,feel free to DM me.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.53,0:01:20.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,Let's build something together!
